 each piece of loot is as meaningful as it is unhinged.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> </strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1823390/extras/EtME_SteamStore_GIF_04.gif?t=1746725874\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Strategize in the Blink of an Eye</i></strong><br>Masterfully employ your heroes and their items in order to survive the apocalypse. Pause the action at any moment to instantly use spells, abilities and consumables, turning the tide of the battle in your favor!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1823390/extras/EtME_SteamStore_GIF_05.gif?t=1746725874\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Construct Mad Machines</i></strong><br>Your hub is your sanctuary. There you can use the Crystals of Reality to build awesome machines, which allow you to recruit, upgrade or restore heroes, buy, craft, identify or enchant gear, and more. Relax as you theorycraft the ultimate party! \u00a0 .</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1823390/extras/EtME_SteamStore_GIF_06.gif?t=1746725874\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Chart Your Way Through the Apocalypse</i></strong><br>In each daring attempt at escape, you will chart your own path through the cavernous maze dug out by the Mad Empire. Take daring risks to reap big rewards, and face bosses at the end of each run. With each successful escape, your heroes are rewarded with resources used to develop your home base, and let you continue your journey through the Mad Empire\u2019s apocalypse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Will you Escape the Mad Empire?</strong></p>","developers":["XperimentalZ Games"],"genres":[{"description":"